          %title
          %p
            Cumrun Vafa is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+theory"} string theorist
            at Harvard.
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "https://www.cumrunvafa.org/"} personal webpage
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "http://physics.harvard.edu/~vafa/"} institute website
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cumrun_Vafa"} Wikipedia entry
          %h2#SelectedWritings Selected writings
          %p
            On the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/group+action"} action
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/modular+group"} modular group
            on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spin+structures"} spin structures
            over
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/closed+manifold"} closed
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/surfaces"} surfaces
            in relation to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/theta+functions"} theta functions
            and
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+scattering+amplitude"} string amplitudes
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Luis+Alvarez-Gaum%C3%A9"}> Luis Alvarez-Gaumé
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gregory+Moore"} Gregory Moore
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cumrun+Vafa"} Cumrun Vafa
              = succeed "," do
                %em Theta functions, modular invariance, and strings
              %strong 106
              (1986) 1–40 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01210925"}> doi:10.1007/BF01210925
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://projecteuclid.org/journals/communications-in-mathematical-physics/volume-106/issue-1/Theta-functions-modular-invariance-and-strings/cmp/1104115581.full"} eculid:cmp/1104115581
          %p
            Introducing what came to be called the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Brandenberger-Vafa+mechanism"} Brandenberger-Vafa mechanism
            in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+theory"} string theoretic
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cosmology"} cosmology
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Robert+Brandenberger"}> Robert Brandenberger
              ,
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cumrun+Vafa"} Cumrun Vafa
              = succeed "," do
                %em Superstrings in the Early Universe
              %strong 316
              (1989) 391 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://inspirehep.net/record/263348"}> spire263348
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/0550-3213(89)90037-0"} doi:10.1016/0550-3213(89)90037-0
          %p
            On the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+cohomology"} quantum cohomology
            induced by
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supersymmetry"} supersymmetric
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/CP%5EN+sigma-model"}
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi ℂ
                      %msup
                        %mi P
                        %mi N
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{C}P^N
                sigma-models
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sergio+Cecotti"}> Sergio Cecotti
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cumrun+Vafa"} Cumrun Vafa
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Exact Results for Supersymmetric Sigma Models
                %strong 68
                (1992) 903-906 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9111016"}> arXiv:hep-th/9111016
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.68.903"} doi:10.1103/PhysRevLett.68.903
            %li#CecottiVafa93
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sergio+Cecotti"}> Sergio Cecotti
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cumrun+Vafa"} Cumrun Vafa
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    On Classification of
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi N
                          %mo =
                          %mn 2
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N=2
                    Supersymmetric Theories
                %strong 158
                (1993) 569-644 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9211097"}> arXiv:hep-th/9211097
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BF02096804"} doi:10.1007/BF02096804
          %p
            On how the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/second+quantization"} second quantization
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/B-model"} B-model
            yields
            = succeed "/" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kodeira-Spencer+gravity"} Kodeira-Spencer gravity
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/BCOV+theory"} BCOV theory
          %ul
            %li#BCOV93
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Bershadsky"}> Michael Bershadsky
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sergio+Cecotti"} Sergio Cecotti
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hirosi+Ooguri"} Hirosi Ooguri
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cumrun+Vafa"} Cumrun Vafa
              = succeed "," do
                %em Kodaira-Spencer Theory of Gravity and Exact Results for Quantum String Amplitudes
              %strong 165
              (1994) 311-428 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9309140"}> arXiv:hep-th/9309140
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/BF02099774"} doi:10.1007/BF02099774
          %p
            Introducing the idea of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/F-theory"} F-theory
          %ul
            %li#Vafa96
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cumrun+Vafa"}> Cumrun Vafa
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Evidence for F-theory
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9602022"} arXiv:hep-th/9602022
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/F-theory"} F-theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KK-compactification"} KK-compactified
            on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Calabi-Yau+manifolds"} Calabi-Yau manifolds
            and
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/duality+between+F-theory+and+heterotic+string+theory"} duality between F-theory and heterotic string theory
          %ul
            %li#MorrisonVafa96a
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Morrison"}> David Morrison
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cumrun+Vafa"} Cumrun Vafa
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Compactifications of F-Theory on Calabi–Yau Threefolds – I
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9602114"} arXiv:hep-th/9602114
            %li#MorrisonVafa96b
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Morrison"}> David Morrison
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cumrun+Vafa"} Cumrun Vafa
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Compactifications of F-Theory on Calabi–Yau Threefolds – II
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9603161"} arXiv:hep-th/9603161
          %p
            Introducing the idea of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+cohomology"} quantum cohomology
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cumrun+Vafa"}> Cumrun Vafa
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Topological mirrors and quantum rings
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shing-Tung+Yau"} Shing-Tung Yau
              (ed.)
              = succeed "," do
                %em Essays on mirror manifolds
              = succeed "," do
                %em Mirror Symmetry I
              %strong 9
              (1998) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9111017"}> arXiv:hep-th/9111017
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1090/amsip/009"} doi:10.1090/amsip/009
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chern-Simons+theory+as+a+topological+string+theory"} Chern-Simons theory as a topological string theory
            (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/open%2Fclosed+string+duality"} open/closed string duality
            in interpreting
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%27t+Hooft+double+line+notation"} 't Hooft double line notation
            in the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/large+N+limit"} large N limit
            and in
            = succeed ");" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/AdS%2FCFT+duality"} AdS/CFT duality
          %ul
            %li#GopakumarVafa98
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Rajesh+Gopakumar"}> Rajesh Gopakumar
